30 Must-Know DevOps Questions That Can Land You an 18 LPA Package.

If you’re preparing for mid-to-senior DevOps roles, these are the type of questions interviewers ask.

Here’s a solid list of 30 DevOps questions to sharpen your prep:

🔹 CI/CD & Automation
1) How do you design a CI/CD pipeline for microservices running in Kubernetes?
2) How do you implement zero-downtime deployments in Jenkins or GitHub Actions?
3) How do you secure pipelines against supply chain attacks?
4) How do you manage parallel builds and artifacts in Jenkins/GitLab?
5) Explain blue/green vs. canary deployments—when would you choose one over the other?

🔹 Docker & Containers
6) How do you optimize a Dockerfile for performance and security?
7) How do you handle secrets inside containers?
8) Explain image layering in Docker—how can it cause cache busting?
9) What strategies do you use for debugging container networking issues?10) How do you run multi-container apps in production without Compose?

🔹 Kubernetes (K8s)
11) How does Kubernetes handle self-healing at pod and node level?
12) Difference between ReplicaSet, Deployment, StatefulSet, and DaemonSet?
13) How do you troubleshoot CrashLoopBackOff or ImagePullBackOff errors?
14) How do you implement PodDisruptionBudgets and why are they critical?
15) What’s the role of etcd in Kubernetes, and how do you back it up?
16) How do you secure a Kubernetes cluster (RBAC, PSP, NetworkPolicy)?

🔹 Terraform & IaC
17) How do you handle drift detection in Terraform?
18) What’s the impact of terraform refresh vs. terraform plan?
19) How do you structure large Terraform projects using workspaces and modules?
20) How do you manage state locking and avoid conflicts in remote backends?
21) How do you test Terraform code before deploying to production?

🔹 Cloud & Monitoring
22) How do you design an auto-scaling strategy in AWS for high-traffic apps?
23) How do you secure an S3 bucket used for static website hosting?
24) How do you monitor Kubernetes clusters with Prometheus and Grafana?
25) How do you implement centralized logging across distributed microservices?
26) Explain chaos engineering—how would you use it in production?

🔹 Linux & Troubleshooting
27) How do you troubleshoot a memory leak in a production Linux server?
28) How do you handle zombie and orphan processes?
29) How do you debug high I/O latency in Linux systems?
30) How do you investigate intermittent packet loss between containers or nodes?

These aren’t beginner “what is Docker?” questions—these are real-world, scenario-driven challenges you’ll face in 18 LPA+ DevOps interviews.
